Description: Seamless USB tethering and Wi-Fi band control for jailbroken iPhones and iPads. Share your device's Wi-Fi or VPN with a computer over USB, and keep Wi-Fi on 5 GHz or 2.4 GHz even on routers that won't allow band splitting. USB tethering needs the Share tweak (the app adds its repo); band control works on its own. Rootless, iOS 15+.
